===persian===

هشت سال...
شاگردی کبوتران کردم...
پرواز نیاموختم...
پروازِ بی‌بال...
مثلِ آوازِ بی‌حال...
مثلِ شعر... مثلِ نقاشی...
اگر عاشق نباشی... آموختنی نیست...
فروردین ۱۳۷۰

===machine===

Eight years...
I apprenticed myself to the doves...
I did not learn to fly...
Flight without wings...
is like a song without spirit...
like a poem... like a painting...
If you are not in love... it cannot be taught...
Farvardin 1370

===lantern===

Eight years
I served my apprenticeship to the doves.
I never learned to fly.
Flight without wings
is like a song with no spirit in it,
like a poem... like a painting...
If you are not in love, it cannot be taught...

Farvardin 1370

===translation===

===footnotes===

Eight years is the exact length of the war, Shahrivar ۱۳۵۹ to Mordad ۱۳۶۷. The doves are
the ones he lets go at the close of *not-having*, on the last page of the previous batch.
